  "changes": [
    "Persist source-decode-failed-v1 only through normal worker failure journal; bind exact current manifest hash, checking-sources stage, index/count/path before exposing source remedy. No output/publication, multitrack legacy ambiguity stays unknown, finite tag repair remains singleMP3.",
    "Backend books-media-failure-v1 distinguishes chapter feature unsupported from invalid M4B and source audio failures; row/panel/Jobs get typed filename/status/hint. Raw errors remain Technical details; no invented repair/delete control; invalid media counts Other, feature counts Unsupported.",
    "Exact old Unsupported chapter image sample entry cohort enters existing source-preserving retry path. Full current review/native source/profile proof and child CAS unchanged; old parent row immutable. Successful admission is not a future failure retry (otherwise automatic Start waited an hour after success).",
    "Names editor read enters thread-local catalog-only scope; no grouping lock or writes to shared approval/peer caches. Save requires nonblocking existing admission locks or finite busy409 without blocking refresh; explicit retry keeps fresh generation/CAS. Direct output-folder and gone-source fallback aliases use guarded catalog-only identity lookup.",
    "Only packageLockSha256 changed to reviewed committed0.25.0 raw lock01d87e0d44a2b4485d5d674121fc1389cfa2092fd1b7a10c6ce7ca846f6c86a5; Sully verified graph identical except two root version values, all2301 seed/tool file pins unchanged."
  ],
  "results": {
    "python": "Final83-case cohort82PASS, sole existing long coauthor/series fixture path refused >240. Actual inherited fixture lives in test_automatic_processing.AREA; private driver mapping shortened to ap only, unchanged test then PASS7.348s/nativezero. No production path limit or test assertion weakened.",
    "worker_bridge": "Real AudioJobs worker/checkpoint/failure journal→source_remedy→media filename12/57 PASS, no output/publication, frozen manifest unchanged.",
    "normal_start": "Actual AAC+PNG chapter graph: real old parser refusal/closed attempt seeded; corrected committed parser + ordinary AutomaticProcessing.start admit one child, finish whole pass, verified output and immutable old row.21-case cohortPASS13.535s. Initial97s waits exposed successful-admission retryable flag bug; not hidden by timeout changes.",
    "concurrency": "Names HTTP baseline answered after worker release0.630s vsrelease0.504s; corrected~0.10s while group/review/operation locks still held. Save baseline blocked; corrected busy409 immediate, then normal HTTP retry persists Series/Universe/Title and valid stale generation refused. Output/direct fallback held-lock passes.",
    "frontend": "Four existing scripts PASS (attention, refused retry, retry, inline series). Typed row/panel/Jobs agree; raw codec trace only technical, stale retry suppressed. Known pending/unknown cause copy retained.",
    "preserved_failures": "All initial failure/fixture receipts are included, with corrected proof. Final source is frozen; no further code refinements after completed required checks."
  },
  "graph": "All new cases are in existing test_attention_failure_policy.py, test_automatic_media.py, test_lock_timing.py and existing test_*.js discovery. No runner/build graph/weights change; root modules collect automatically.",
